OL,3,GNEWSANorthern to introduce
OL,4,Aair-conditioned trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FAir-conditioned trains are due to be
OL,7,Fintroduced on Northern routes across
OL,8,FManchester and the wider North West
OL,9,Ffrom early 2028.
OL,11,FThe operator said 37 refurbished trains
OL,12,Fwould replace its ageing Class 323
OL,13,Ffleet, which is nearing the end of its
OL,14,Fworking life.
OL,16,FNorthern said the trains would provide
OL,17,Fmore capacity and extra space for
OL,18,Fpassengers, as well as luggage racks
OL,19,Fand power sockets on many routes.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
