OL,3,GNEWSANorthern to introduce
OL,4,Aair-conditioned trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FManaging director Tricia Williams said
OL,7,Fthe trains would offer 'air
OL,8,Fconditioning, more carriages, more
OL,9,Fspace and a more pleasant environment
OL,10,Fthroughout'.
